                "title": "4 x 5/8 Radius THERMA-TRU Spring Hinge",
                "description": "Deltana DSH4R5T THERMA-TRU Spring Hinge. - 4 x 4 x 5/8 Radius Corners Spring Hinge Single Action, 0.097 thick (gauge). Packaged complete with 1 Single Action Hinge, Allen Wrench, Adjusting Pin, Box with Wood  Screws and  Machine Screws. Available in 9 different finish colors.",
